<p>Create deployment using YAML file: kubectl apply -f C:\Users\Brando\Documents\repos\kube-nginx/deployment.yaml</p>
<p>Create Service to expose nginx: kubectl expose deployment/kube-nginx --type="LoadBalancer" --port 8080 --target-port 80</p>
